      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd take it a step further and make it so any instance, group, or avatar marked as 18+ is not even visible anywhere in game or on the website to people who are not 18+ verified.\n\n- If Group A is marked as 18+ by the owner of the group, then if someone who is not 18+ verified searches for groups inside of VRChat, it won't even show on the list even if they search directly for it. They'd be unable to join it even if they somehow found it.\n\n- If someone is using an avatar they uploaded and marked as 18+, then that avatar will be a fallback to anyone not 18+ verified no matter their shield settings; and even if that avatar could be made safe with toggles. Also, marking your avatar as 18+ would automatically make it non-public.\n\n- If someone creates an instance that is 18+ verified only, then it would never show on instance lists for that world or anywhere else for someone who is not 18+ verified. If a non-verified friend sees you on their friend list and you are in an 18+ world, they would simply see you in \"Private\" and would not be able to join or request on you, no matter your status.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
